{"id": "q0023", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4294256, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "Skyler has 100 hats on his hand with the colors red, blue, and white. Half of the hats are red, 3/5 of the remaining hats are blue, and the rest are white. How many white hats does Skyler have?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0023.wav", "input_sha256": "57b96041cbcd1aea8251057468152525f1e69c7067b08783b18550b8a4009bbd", "input_samples": 256800, "input_s": 16.05, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.134, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So we know that half of the hats are red, so that's 50. The remaining hats are blue and white, which means there are 50 hats left. Three- fifths of those are blue, so three-fifths of 5 0 is 3 0. That leaves us with 2 0 hats that are white.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 16, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 15, "feed_lag_max_ms": 93, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 93, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0023_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "a8127b9b3ee5460b0f5ad55b3cc6ed37ca65a8e68da41d75829e98179b3924c9", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 14.6}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.074, 1.134, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.074, 2.133, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.074, 3.131, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.076, 4.141, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.077, 5.138, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.076, 6.136, 1, 0