{"id": "q0495", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 232739410, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "创建一个程序将动物分类到不同的组中。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0495.wav", "input_sha256": "7b886e4768c29eb5cc29c2f6d4325794a5bbd188bb170da8d0c4e8eea3c8f8a4", "input_samples": 63400, "input_s": 3.962, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.2325, "act": 0.9989, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "我们可以创建一个程序，把动物按照不同的组别来分类。比如说可以根据它们的特征来分，比如是哺乳动物、鸟类、爬行动物还是水生动物等。这样写代码的时候就可以先列出一些动物的名字，然后根据每种动物的特点把它放到对应的组里去。通过这样的方式，程序就能自动完成分类任务了。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 26, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0495_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "000e832af6bde16d37d8b4be79a494bb5d0cc2ec4a9dc9d2b5f9dfec314bb9ec", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 25.84}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.082, 1.145, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.083, 2.147, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.076, 3.138, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.962, 4.044, 4.106, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.963, 5.043, 5.496, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.963, 6.043, 6.873, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.963, 7.047, 7.843, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.963, 8.046, 8.849, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.963, 9.045, 9.739, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.963, 10.046, 10.75, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.963, 11.047, 11.866, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.963, 12.044, 12.706, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.963, 13.048, 13.757, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.963, 